owing innovation. Blexr containerized its infrastructure on AWS and took advantage of scalable AWS services to improve agility, increase conversion rates by 30 percent, and accelerate new market launches from 9 months to 3 weeks. Now, it’s positioned to continue delivering a great customer experience as it expands globally.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/blexr-logo%401x.d4e49bede8d29dc8cd25e29f30ca9e2e32e59e1a.png","displayLocation":"Malta","customerNameLower":"blexr","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Gaming","sortDate":"2024-06-14","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/blexr?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Blexr","publishedDate":"2024","enableShare":"1","headline":"Accelerating New Market Launches from 9 Months to 3 Weeks on AWS with Blexr","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"customer-references#category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-12T02:01:30+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#containers","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Containers","description":"Containers","dateCreated":"2020-02-13T00:27:17+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:26+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#serverless","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Serverless","description":"Serverless","dateCreated":"2021-07-28T18:46:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#gaming","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Gaming","description":"Gaming","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:21+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:04+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#fargate","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Fargate","description":"AWS Fargate","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:03:25+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:3