0-09T04:18:37+0000","dateUpdated":"2021-12-22T23:24:11+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"By leveraging automation with managed services on AWS, Verrency is saving 200 days of work per deployment and can pass banks’ due diligence checks in a few days or less. Verrency provides APIs to financial institutions to help them innovate faster and at a lower cost. The Australian company uses AWS Fargate for serverless deployment, Amazon MSK to manage Apache Kafka, and Amazon ECS to run containerized applications.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/apac/customer-references-logos-(%401x---%402x)/Verrency_logo%401x.9cc780c9f0cd049d4e3de486f3f9a55982300d55.png","displayLocation":"Australia","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Financial Services","sortDate":"2021-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/verrency-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2021","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Verrency Helps Banks Enrich Their Customer Experience with AWS-Powered “Fast Innovation” API Platform","customer-name":"Verrency"}},"tags":[{"id":"customer-references#category#containers","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Containers","description":"Containers","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:32+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-19T05:00:37+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#australia","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Australia","description":"Australia","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:12+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:35+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#ecr","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Elastic Container Registry (ECR)","description":"Amazon Elastic Container Registry (ECR)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:55+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:32+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCrea