,"tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Americas","description":"Americas","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#networking-content-dev","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","description":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#namer","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"North America","description":"North America","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:03+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:34+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#app-integration","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Application Integration","description":"Application Integration","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:04+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:22+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#aurora","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Aurora","description":"Amazon Aurora","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:01:37+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:18+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#innovator","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Innovator","description":"Innovator","dateCreated":"2022-04-05T21:17:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-06-27T20:43:35+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#analytics","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Analytics","description":"Analytics","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:03+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:22+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#united-states","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"United States","description":"United States","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:08+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:34+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#sqs","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Simple Queue Service (SQS)","description":"Amazon Simple Queue Service (SQS)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:36+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:33:02+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#lambda","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Lambda","description":"AWS Lambda","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:46+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#industry#healthcare-lifesciences","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#industry","name":"healthcare-lifesciences","description":"\u003cp\u003eThis tag is initially being created specifically for the Directory Cards componenet on aws.amazon.com/health/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can use the AND operator to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#vodfactory-video","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"vodfactory-video","dateCreated":"2023-07-18T00:06:06+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-08-11T22:26:57+0000","additionalFields":{"videoSrcUrl":"https://youtu.be/VPAEJXb8FGk","descriptionSummary":"\u003cp\u003eFond\u0026eacute; \u0026agrave; Paris en 2013, VOD Factory est le sp\u0026eacute;cialiste de la vid\u0026eacute;o \u0026agrave; la demande en France. S\u0026rsquo;appuyant sur AWS pour d\u0026eacute;velopper sa solution \u0026quot;Otto\u0026quot;, VOD Factory permet aux propri\u0026eacute;taires de contenu de cr\u0026eacute;er leur propre plateforme de streaming. \u0026Eacute;galement \u0026eacute;diteur de services SVOD (Queerscreen, Shadowz, Spicee), VOD Factory est ainsi en mesure de faire b\u0026eacute;n\u0026eacute;ficier \u0026agrave; ses clients de sa propre exp\u0026eacute;rience m\u0026eacute;tier. Amen\u0026eacute; \u0026agrave; accueillir un nombre important et variable de connexions, VOD Factory tire parti de l\u0026rsquo;\u0026eacute;lasticit\u0026eacute; du Cloud AWS pour adapter son infrastructure \u0026agrave; la demande et garantir \u0026agrave; ses utilisateurs performance et disponibilit\u0026eacute; dans le monde entier. Dans cette vid\u0026eacute;o, Julien Vin-Ramarony, Pr\u0026eacute;sident de VOD Factory, nous explique pourquoi ses \u0026eacute;quipes ont fait appel \u0026agrave; AWS et nous \u0026eacute;claire sur les d\u0026eacute;fis que son entreprise souhaite relever \u0026agrave; l\u0026#39;avenir.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/VOD%20Factory%20-%20logo.302dad665c7b364e85940ceab56b226a4f5fc51e.png","displayLocation":"Europe, Moyen-Orient et Afrique","footerInfoText":"Date de publication","industry":"Logiciels et Internet","sortDate":"2021-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/fr/solutions/case-studies/vodfactory-video/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"VOD Factory","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2021","contentType":"Témoignages clients","headline":"VOD Factory : l\u0027histoire d\u0027une solution clé en main pour créer sa propre plateforme de streaming"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#elastic-inference","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Elastic Inference","description":"Amazon Elastic Inference","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:03:04+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#savings-plans","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Savings Plans","description":"Savings Plans","dateCreated":"2021-09-27T07:50:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-