"dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:36+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#pernodricard","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"pernodricard","dateCreated":"2023-07-17T23:44:54+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-08-16T22:09:17+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Le leader mondial des vins et spiritueux déploie ses plateformes e-commerce B2C et B2B à travers le monde depuis 5 ans avec AWS. Les équipes Pernod Ricard ont commencé à utiliser des services Amazon Web Services 3 ans avant ce projet pour déployer des instances pour des projets web. Convaincue par les bénéfices apportés par le Cloud AWS, aujourd’hui la société a lancé plus de 33 sites à travers le monde.","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/pernod_ricard_logo.51647964b5e97572ea4d29e7d53f6dd9343b23de.jpg","displayLocation":"France","customerNameLower":"pernod ricard","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Consumer Packaged Goods (CPG)","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/fr/solutions/case-studies/pernod_ricard/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","enableShare":"1","customer-name":"PERNOD RICARD","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Pernod Ricard distille ses plateformes e-commerce à l’international grâce à AWS"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#language#french","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"French","description":"French","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:24+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#elasticache","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon ElastiCache","description":"Amazon ElastiCache","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T00:13:21+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#databases","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Databases","description":"Databases","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:27+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#aurora","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#pro